### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Create a student (uses dummy data)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student_id": "STU001",
  "name": "Aarav Sharma",
  "date_of_birth": "2005-04-12",
  "email": "aarav@example.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "course": "BCA",
  "address": "Dehradun",
  "enrollment_date": "2026-08-01"
}

### List all students
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/students

### Search students
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/students?search=Aarav

### Get one student
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/students/STU001

### Update selected fields
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/students/STU001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "course": "BSc Computer Science"
}

### Delete a student
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/students/STU001
